(7283197, 1135213, 124815, '<td valign="top">The qualities of a good book cover. Your elaborate processing somehow works well here.<br/>The tree on the right seems to have been taken from a painting, a Watteau perhaps.</td>', 'The qualities of a good book cover. Your elaborate processing somehow works well here.The tree on the right seems to have been taken from a painting, a Watteau perhaps.', '2014-11-10 11:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
