(7283306, 1135233, 86447, '<td valign="top">7 from me.  I think the blown sky adds to this... but I''m sure some will complain.<br/> <br/>It makes it graphics art-like to me.</td>', '7 from me.  I think the blown sky adds to this... but I''m sure some will complain. It makes it graphics art-like to me.', '2014-11-10 14:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7283307, 1135280, 86447, '<td valign="top">7 from me.  Love that sunshine!</td>', '7 from me.  Love that sunshine!', '2014-11-10 14:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7283308, 1134736, 86447, '<td valign="top">7 from me.   It''s well composed but... somehow it needs something to really grab me in.   It seems a bit dreary to me.</td>', '7 from me.   It''s well composed but... somehow it needs something to really grab me in.   It seems a bit dreary to me.', '2014-11-10 14:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7283309, 1134610, 86447, '<td valign="top">I gave this a <strike>7</strike>8.  I love everything about it... except for the people. <br/> <br/>Without the people, it would be my highest scoring image of the challenge with a perfect 10.<br/> <br/>I''d have waited until they left.  *sigh*<br/> <br/>THe processing is lovely... there''s just a bit of weird grainy stuff in the middle of each left and right side... but that''s not a deal breaker as the people are.<br/> <br/>I hope this does well for you.</td>', 'I gave this a 78.  I love everything about it... except for the people.  Without the people, it would be my highest scoring image of the challenge with a perfect 10. I''d have waited until they left.  *sigh* THe processing is lovely... there''s just a bit of weird grainy stuff in the middle of each left and right side... but that''s not a deal breaker as the people are. I hope this does well for you.', '2014-11-10 14:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7283348, 1135168, 113078, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph!</td>', 'Beautiful photograph!', '2014-11-10 16:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7283349, 1135140, 113078, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, I love the light in all the darkness.</td>', 'Beautiful, I love the light in all the darkness.', '2014-11-10 16:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7283350, 1135232, 113078, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2014-11-10 16:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7283370, 1135144, 30490, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this image, but would have liked it better if it wasn''t taken through a car window.  I''m sure that is what you intended, but it makes it seem like a snapshot, not a planned out photo for this challenge.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this image, but would have liked it better if it wasn''t taken through a car window.  I''m sure that is what you intended, but it makes it seem like a snapshot, not a planned out photo for this challenge.', '2014-11-10 17:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7283371, 1135107, 30490, '<td valign="top">Too abstract for me, almost looks like a KKK cross burning, and maybe that was your intent.</td>', 'Too abstract for me, almost looks like a KKK cross burning, and maybe that was your intent.', '2014-11-10 17:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7283373, 1135076, 30490, '<td valign="top">An interesting building, but the image quality is poor.  Looks like a badly scanned black and white photo, which judging by your title might have been the effect you were looking for.  It just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'An interesting building, but the image quality is poor.  Looks like a badly scanned black and white photo, which judging by your title might have been the effect you were looking for.  It just doesn''t work for me.', '2014-11-10 17:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7283374, 1135074, 30490, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, just isn''t an excellent execution.</td>', 'Not a bad idea, just isn''t an excellent execution.', '2014-11-10 17:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7283378, 1135188, 30490, '<td valign="top">Poor image clarity and I''m not sure if this was a church in a former life or not.  This one just didn''t work for me.</td>', 'Poor image clarity and I''m not sure if this was a church in a former life or not.  This one just didn''t work for me.', '2014-11-10 17:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284025, 1135129, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  Interesting roof lines, lovely warm stone and light shining through the center stained glass window, but I wish the siren/speakers weren''t so prominent. In part because they are such an anomaly my eye gets drawn right to them!</td>', 'Lovely image.  Interesting roof lines, lovely warm stone and light shining through the center stained glass window, but I wish the siren/speakers weren''t so prominent. In part because they are such an anomaly my eye gets drawn right to them!', '2014-11-11 12:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284276, 1135201, 38162, '<td valign="top">swarmy title aside, this is one super capture.  best of luck.  7.</td>', 'swarmy title aside, this is one super capture.  best of luck.  7.', '2014-11-11 19:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284284, 1134610, 38162, '<td valign="top">this is a 10 without the cardboard "worshipers" - they kill this terrific image. don''t know if this will be a DQ or not.  gl</td>', 'this is a 10 without the cardboard "worshipers" - they kill this terrific image. don''t know if this will be a DQ or not.  gl', '2014-11-11 19:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284286, 1135074, 38162, '<td valign="top">as an atheist I applaud this one for all the "wrong reasons" of course.  */*  gl.  10.</td>', 'as an atheist I applaud this one for all the "wrong reasons" of course.  */*  gl.  10.', '2014-11-11 19:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284289, 1135223, 38162, '<td valign="top">leaning a bit eh?  in PS: filter-lens correction-custom ...</td>', 'leaning a bit eh?  in PS: filter-lens correction-custom ...', '2014-11-11 19:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284556, 1135125, 42013, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, you''ve revisited this scene for fall. Good luck!</td>', 'Ahhh, you''ve revisited this scene for fall. Good luck!', '2014-11-12 01:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284702, 1135221, 170281, '<td valign="top">Definite points for creativity.</td>', 'Definite points for creativity.', '2014-11-12 10:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284704, 1135084, 170281, '<td valign="top">I do not know what it is about a church sitting out in an open area with little or no structures nearby that makes for an appealing image.  Nice image.</td>', 'I do not know what it is about a church sitting out in an open area with little or no structures nearby that makes for an appealing image.  Nice image.', '2014-11-12 10:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284705, 1134804, 170281, '<td valign="top">Quaint little church.  I think it image is a bit over-exposed due to shot taken into the sun.</td>', 'Quaint little church.  I think it image is a bit over-exposed due to shot taken into the sun.', '2014-11-12 10:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284706, 1135070, 170281, '<td valign="top">Nice use of reflections.</td>', 'Nice use of reflections.', '2014-11-12 10:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284707, 1134944, 170281, '<td valign="top">Nice simplicity with focus on the symbol of the Christian Church.</td>', 'Nice simplicity with focus on the symbol of the Christian Church.', '2014-11-12 10:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284708, 1134984, 170281, '<td valign="top">Nice parallelism with the telephone pole.</td>', 'Nice parallelism with the telephone pole.', '2014-11-12 10:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284724, 1135080, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  The capture of the suns rays and framing is great.</td>', 'Very well done.  The capture of the suns rays and framing is great.', '2014-11-12 11:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284883, 1135153, 176157, '<td valign="top"><strike></strike></td>', '', '2014-11-12 23:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284901, 1135125, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great light and colors.</td>', 'Great light and colors.', '2014-11-13 06:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284902, 1135140, 156466, '<td valign="top">Top is just a little too dark for me.  I suspect it looked less dark against a darker gray like PS or LR uses.  Nice mood captured.</td>', 'Top is just a little too dark for me.  I suspect it looked less dark against a darker gray like PS or LR uses.  Nice mood captured.', '2014-11-13 06:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284903, 1135191, 156466, '<td valign="top">Oooo - wish you had cloned out that power line and its shadow.</td>', 'Oooo - wish you had cloned out that power line and its shadow.', '2014-11-13 06:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284904, 1135188, 156466, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a home than a house of worship.</td>', 'Looks more like a home than a house of worship.', '2014-11-13 06:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284905, 1134610, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen and framed, I just wish the people were a little less cooked by the processing.</td>', 'Nicely seen and framed, I just wish the people were a little less cooked by the processing.', '2014-11-13 06:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284906, 1135192, 156466, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tighter crop and a little less halo?</td>', 'Maybe a tighter crop and a little less halo?', '2014-11-13 06:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284907, 1135260, 156466, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light</td>', 'Beautiful light', '2014-11-13 06:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284908, 1135245, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great sky and nicely processed.  Feels a little dark in the shadows right up front.</td>', 'Great sky and nicely processed.  Feels a little dark in the shadows right up front.', '2014-11-13 06:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284909, 1135070, 156466, '<td valign="top">So wish that light wasn''t in the reflection, nor the wire.</td>', 'So wish that light wasn''t in the reflection, nor the wire.', '2014-11-13 06:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284911, 1134953, 156466, '<td valign="top">Would love a little more detail in the dark areas.  Against this site''s background color what little is there can disappear.</td>', 'Would love a little more detail in the dark areas.  Against this site''s background color what little is there can disappear.', '2014-11-13 06:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284913, 1134984, 156466, '<td valign="top">Trying to figure out if I like the "everything is bent" perspective (I assume it''s on a hill).</td>', 'Trying to figure out if I like the "everything is bent" perspective (I assume it''s on a hill).', '2014-11-13 06:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284914, 1135110, 156466, '<td valign="top">The fenced in areas a little distracting, particularly on the left.  Otherwise I really like this one.</td>', 'The fenced in areas a little distracting, particularly on the left.  Otherwise I really like this one.', '2014-11-13 06:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284915, 1135232, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice leading line, but a little heavy in the dark contrasts - it pulls my eye away from the subject.</td>', 'Nice leading line, but a little heavy in the dark contrasts - it pulls my eye away from the subject.', '2014-11-13 06:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284916, 1135168, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great sky and nicely processed.</td>', 'Great sky and nicely processed.', '2014-11-13 06:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284917, 1135153, 156466, '<td valign="top">I wish the highlights weren''t completely blown at the bottom of the steeple.</td>', 'I wish the highlights weren''t completely blown at the bottom of the steeple.', '2014-11-13 06:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284918, 1135201, 156466, '<td valign="top">Well seen and processed.  Almost looks as if you could be looked down into the sea as well.  Great textures in the clouds.  In my top 3</td>', 'Well seen and processed.  Almost looks as if you could be looked down into the sea as well.  Great textures in the clouds.  In my top 3', '2014-11-13 06:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284919, 1135080, 156466, '<td valign="top">Wow, absolutely phenomenal sky.  I just wish you''d done a little more work with everything below the sky.  Tripod shadow is distracting (obviously there was some source of light, reflected or otherwise behind the camera), and the church front just feels flat. And it all leans right a bit.  It''s a well executed photograph that needs a little more work in post to really make it shine.  7 for the shot, but it could have been much more.</td>', 'Wow, absolutely phenomenal sky.  I just wish you''d done a little more work with everything below the sky.  Tripod shadow is distracting (obviously there was some source of light, reflected or otherwise behind the camera), and the church front just feels flat. And it all leans right a bit.  It''s a well executed photograph that needs a little more work in post to really make it shine.  7 for the shot, but it could have been much more.', '2014-11-13 06:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284961, 1135192, 98339, '<td valign="top">I would have scored this much higher if not for the halo''s around the church and trees.  You have a wonderful subject.</td>', 'I would have scored this much higher if not for the halo''s around the church and trees.  You have a wonderful subject.', '2014-11-13 11:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284967, 1134736, 149964, '<td valign="top">Is this Bath Abbey? If not, it looks very similar - I can even spot the falling angel! Lovely picture.</td>', 'Is this Bath Abbey? If not, it looks very similar - I can even spot the falling angel! Lovely picture.', '2014-11-13 11:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7284979, 1135086, 149964, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture and one of my favourites. Love the simplicity of the church and the contrast provided by the leaves.</td>', 'Beautiful picture and one of my favourites. Love the simplicity of the church and the contrast provided by the leaves.', '2014-11-13 12:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
